{"id":"n58836-1-7","stage":5,"title":"병세 · 病情","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58836-1-7-1","ko":"지수의 병세가 나빠지고 있다면서?","zh":"听说智秀的病情正在恶化？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수의","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"지수의","audio":"/audio/b4b97866ce0a3cb24126.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수의","audio":"/audio/b4b97866ce0a3cb24126.mp3"}},{"text":"병세가","meaning":"病情，病势","explanation":"병세：病情，病势；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"병세","audio":"/audio/6fa3624930d1e6cd696e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58836","senseId":"1","lemma":"병세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병세가","audio":"/audio/be2283091cf2294abecf.mp3"}},{"text":"나빠지고","meaning":"变坏，恶化","explanation":"나빠지다：变坏，恶化；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나빠지다","audio":"/audio/6b282f137367c501596d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59497","senseId":"1","lemma":"나빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나빠지고","audio":"/audio/1b7a1e9728a618eacfbf.mp3"}},{"text":"있다면서?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다면서","audio":"/audio/8d10f5d507c3781e8a98.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fa3624930d1e6cd","term":"병세","zh":"病情，病势","audio":"/audio/6fa3624930d1e6cd696e.mp3","entryId":"58836","definition":"疾病的症状或状态。","pronunciation":["병ː세"]},{"id":"6b282f137367c501","term":"나빠지다","zh":"变坏，恶化","audio":"/audio/6b282f137367c501596d.mp3","entryId":"59497","definition":"向坏的方面变化。","pronunciation":["나빠지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c13c3e85bb70b415d146.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58836-1-7-2","ko":"응. 그래도 병원에서는 할 수 있는 치료를 다 하고 있어.","zh":"嗯。不过医院已经在尽一切可能为她进行治疗了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에서는","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에서는","audio":"/audio/02d27f24c8a673fc681f.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]